<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">Joshua</book>
  <para style="h">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="mt">Joshua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ nasem Moses a si zaw ciengin Topa in Moses’ a hupa Nun tapa Joshua hopi-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka nasempa Moses si zo hi. Tu-in ding inlen nangma le tam mite zosie in Jodan gun kantanin Israel-te tunga ka pieh gam sungah pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses tunga ka ciemsa ma bangin na ketaw in a totna mun popo nangma kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Senel gam le tam Lebanon gama kipanin gun lienpi Euphrates gun dong, nitumna lama Tuipi Lien lam, Hit-te leitang zosie nangma’ gam hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hin sung tungtawnin koima in ang langpan zo sih ding hi. Moses tawh ka opton bangin nang tawh zong kang om ton ding hi; kang tamasah sih ding a, zong kang nuasie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thahat inlen hang in; azieh pen na pu na pate uh pieh dinga ka ciemsa leitang tam mite na luosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tha hatin hang inlen, ka nasempa Moses ang pieh thukham zosie tawh kizui-in na gamtat ding limtahin ngaisun in; na peina popo-ah na lawcin thei nadingin zietlam ahi a, veilam ahi zongin piel sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kam le tami thukham laibu na kilawisah sih ding hi; tua sunga kigiel teng zosie tawh kizui-in limtaha na gamtat thei nadingin sun le zanin na lung ngaingai ding hi. Tua hile na ma vang ding a, na lawcing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam bangin thu kang pie hi: Tha hat inlen hang in. Zau sinlen lungkie sin, azieh pen na peina popo-ah nangma tawh Topa na Pasien ang om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in mipi uliente thupie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Giephual ah pei unlen, mite tam bangin thupie un: ‘Na lam-an ding uh kiging un; azieh pen Topa na Pasien un na nei ding vua ang pieh leitang a luo dingin ni thum sungin tam Jordan a galkai ding na hi uhi,’ ci un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joshua in Reuben-te, Gad-te, Manasseh minam alangte kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Topa na Pasien un tawlngahna hing pie-in tam leitang ang pie ding hi, ci-in Topa’ nasem Moses a thupieh phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses in Jordan gal khat a ang pieh leitangah na zite, na tasente ule na ganhingte a om ding uhi. Ahi vangin note lahah galhang zosie in hiem tawi-in Jordan kantanin na sanggamte mai-ah pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in no ang pieh bangin na sanggamte uh tungah tawlngahna pie-in, Topa na Pasien un amate a pieh leitang a luo masangsie-un na panpi ding uhi. Tua ciengin na leitang vuah kilekia-in, Topa’ nasem Moses in Jordan gal nisuona lamah ang pieh leitang na luo ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in tam bangin Joshua a dawng uhi: “Kote in nei thupieh zosie ka sem ding vua, nei sawlna popo-ah ka pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sil bangkimah Moses thu ka man bang tehtehun na thu ka mang ding uhi. Topa na Pasien in Moses a ompi bangin nang zong hing ompi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na thupiehnate a ledo le na kammal a mang lo poma, na thupieh popo a mang lo poma kithat ding hi. Thahatin na han ding beh ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Nun’ tapa Joshua in Shittim panin thukan ding mi ni sawl a, “Pei-in gam va en ta unlen, a diehdiehin Jericho khuo va en ta un,” a ci hi. Ama gel zong pei pai-in Rahab kici numei pahtat khat’ inn ah tungin a gieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jericho kumpipa kungah, “Gam sung en dingin Israel-te pawlkhat tuzanin ang tung hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jericho kumpipa in Rahab kungah mi sawl a, “Na inn sunga ang tum, na kunga ang tung mite hing peipi in. Azieh pen gam buppi thu a kandap dinga ang pei uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle tua numei in mi nite la-in a phuoldap hi. Tua ziehin ama in, “Hima hi, tua mite ka kungah ang pei ma uhi, ahi vangin hei sung pana hing kipan gel ahei ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kulkotpi a kikha hun khuomiel ciengin tua mite a peikhie uhi. Tua mite hei lam manaw gel ahei ci zong ka thei tuon sih hi. Ama gel del meng un, azieh pen na pha lai ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in innkhum zangah tua mite peipi to-in butu kung a lomloma kikoina munah a phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite in Jordan lamah tanmun dong delin a delte a peikhiet zaw lienun kulkotpi kikha pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama gel a lup masangin innkhum zanga a kung vuah Rahab kato a, tua gel kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Topa in tam leitang note ang pie zo hi, ci ka thei a, tuaci’n kang giing mama vua, tam gam sunga teng mi zosie zong na mai vuah a zausi sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Egypt panin nang peikhiet lai-un Topa in na mai vuah San Tuipi a kansahna le Jordan galkhata om Amor-te’ kumpi nite ahi Sihon le Og tungah na bawlnate uh ka za zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam thu ka zah behun ka lungkie vua, note ziehin a koimapo tungah hanna kici a om ta sih hi. Topa na Pasien uh pen tunglam van le neilam leitung Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin tu-in na tung vua kang dih gamtat bangin no zong ko innkuon tungah nang dihtat nadingun, Topa’ minin ka kungah hing kiciem unlen ciemtena dihtah khat ei pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka nu le ka pa, ka sanggam pasalte, ka sanggam numeite, le amate tawh a kisai zosie ei hinkhawi pieh unlen, sina panin ka hinna uh ei hunkhie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama gel in tua nu kungah, “Nangma’ hinna khu kogel’ hinna ahi hi! Tami ka nasep uh nei sawmsiet sih po nah leh Topa in ko tungah tami leitang ei pieh ciengin na tungah migitah le muonhuoi tahin kang gamta ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rahab in tawlet panin khauhuol tawh ama gel a khiesuh hi, bang ding ahei cile ama’ inn pen khuopikul pulam panga kilam ahi a, khuopikul sungah ama a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua nu in ama gel kungah, “Muol tung lam zuonin pei ta gel in, tua hile ang nuadelte tawh na kituoh sih ding gel hi. Ang delte ang kilekia masangsie tua munah ni thum sung kiphuol gel in; tua ciengin na pei nading vuah na pei thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mite in tua nu kungah, “Tam gam kang sim vua, nei khaisuhna tami tawlet-ah tam khauhuol san na na khi sih a, na inn sunga na nu le na pa, na sanggam pasalte, le na innkuonpi zosie na na khop sih leh, na tunga nei kiciemsah tami kiciemna panin ka peng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na inn sung kotkhah panin mi khatpo pusuohin lam dungah a vahkawi a, sina a tuo leh ama’ sina tungtangah ama in maw puo ding a, ko maw ka peng ding uhi; ahi vangin inn sunga na ompi uh mi khatpo tungah a khut hlangkha ang op leh ama sina tungtangah maw ka puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle tu-a kogel’ nasepnate nei gen leh nei kiciemsah tam kiciemna panin ka peng ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in, “ Na gen bang gelin hi taheh,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in tua gel a sawl dawh a, ama gel a pei ta uhi. Tua ciengin ama in tawlet-ah khauhuol san a khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama gel dingkhie-in muol tung lamah a pei vua, a delte a kilekia masangsie-in khum munah ni thum sung a om uhi. A delte in lam tungtawnin a sui vua, bangma a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin muol tung panin mi nite a kumsuhkia uhi. Ama gel zong galkai-in, Nun’ tapa Joshua kung a tung uhi; a tung vua a pieng zothu sie a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama gel in Joshua kungah, “ Topa in leitang zosie i khut sungah ei pie tahtah zo hi; tua tham loin eite mai-ah gam sunga teng mi zosie a lungtawp sieng uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A zing ciengin Joshua tho bai-in Israel-te zosie tawh Shittim panin dingkhie-in Jordan gun a tung uhi. Khum mun a galkai masangun a gieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni thum a cin zaw ciengin giephuolah uliente pei-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mite thu a pie vua, “Levi siempute in Topa na Pasien uh’ thuciemna singkuong a puoh na mu ciengun na opna mun panun dingkhie-in na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami lampi zui ngai nai lo na hi ziehun na pei nading uh lampi na thei nading uh ahi hi. Ahi vangin noma le thukham singkuong kikalah mun awng tong tulni bang om ding hi; a gei-ah pei sih un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in mite kungah, “No le no kisiensuo un; azieh pen Topa in zing ciengin na lah vuah na lamdang ang bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua in siempute kungah, “Thuciemna singkuong puo unlen mite mai-ah peisuoh un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n thuciemna singkuong puo-in mite mai-ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Joshua kungah, “Amate in Moses ka ompi ma bangin nang zong kang ompi ding lam a thei nadingun Israel-te zosie’ muna-ah tawisang kang kipan ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute kungah, ‘Jordan tuite gei-ah na tun ciengun Jordan tui sungah pia loin ding den un,’ ci-in thu na pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in Israel-te kungah, “Ei nai unlen Topa na Pasien uh’ kammalte ngai un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua in, “Na lah vuah a hing Pasien omin ama in na mai panun pel loin Canaan-te, Hit-te, Perez-te, Girgash-te, Amor-te, le Jebus-te a nawkhietna tami thu tawh na thei ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitung zosie Topa’ thuciemna singkuong khu na masang uh Jordan lui sungah pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in Israel minamte sung panin nam khatah mi khat ta, mi sawm le ni teel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leitung buppi’ Topa ahi Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute’ ketaw in Jordan tuite a totkhah ciengin, a tunglam pana a luongsuh Jordan tuite khawl ding hi; tuate lom khatin a kicieng ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jordan galkai dingin a puon buh panun mite a dinkhiet ciengun mite mai-ah thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anlah hun sung tungtawnin Jordan lui khangin a pieu teng zosie-ah a let hi. Tuaci’n Jordan ah thuciemna singkuong puote a tung vua, tui mongah thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute’ keng a kidie ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a sahlam pana a luongsuh tuite khawlin a gamlapi Zarethan gei-a khuopi Adam-ah lomkhatin kikholin kicieng a, Tuipi Si kici Arabah tuipi-a a luongsuhte zong a kikhentat sieng hi. Tua ciengin Jericho tawh a kigalsaina munah mite a galkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leigaw tungah Israel-te zosie a pei sung uh, minam bupin Jordan a kantan zawh masangsie-un, Jordan laikim leigaw tungah Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minam zosie in Jordan a galkai zaw ciengun, Topa in Joshua kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Minam khat panin mi khat ta, mite sung panin mi sawm le ni teel in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale amate thupie inlen, ‘Jordan gun laikim siempute’ keng a dinna mun panin suongtum sawm le ni la-in puo unlen, tu zana na giena mun vuah tuate koi un,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in Israel-te lah panin mi khat ta, a sesa mi sawm le nite a hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joshua in amate tungah, “ Topa na Pasien uh’ thuciemna singkuong opna mai Jordan gun laikimah pei unlen, Israel minamte sung panin mi khat in suongtum khat ta la-in na liengko vuah puo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam khu na lah vuah theisahna lim hi ding hi. Mailam hunah na tate un, “Tam suongtumte bang a cinopna ahei?’ ci-a ang dawh ciengun a kung vuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa’ thuciemna singkuong mai-ah Jordan tuite kikhenkhe hi. Tua in Jordan a galkai ciengin Jordan tuite kikhenkhe a, tuaci’n tam suongtumte Israel-te adingin kumtawn phawna hi ding hi,” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joshua’ thupiehsa bangin Israel-te a gamta uhi. Topa in Joshua kunga a gensa bangin Israel minamte a phaza tawh kizui-in Jordan gun laikim panin suongtum sawm le ni la-in tuate puo-in a galkai vua, a gienamun vuah tuate a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Joshua in thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute’ keng dinnasa mun, Jordan gun laikimah suongtum sawm le ni phut hi; tuale tuni dongin khum munah tuate a omlai hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses in Joshua a thupiehsa zosie tawh kizui-in mite tungah a genkhie dingin Topa in Joshua tunga a thupieh zosie a unpi-in a kiman sieng masangsie, Jordan laikimah singkuong a puo siempute a ding den uhi. Mallang tahin mite a galkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi zosie a galkai sieng zaw behun mite mai-ah Topa’ thukham singkuong le siempute a galkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in amate a vaihlahsa bangin Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte in hiem tawi-in Israel-te mai-ah a galkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi tul sawmli kim bang gal do dingin hiem tawi-in Jericho zanglei lam Topa mai-ah a galkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ni-in Israel-te mai-ah Topa in Joshua lamsang hi; tuale amate in Moses a zatah bang ma-un a hinsung tungtawnun Joshua zong a zatah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in Joshua kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Jordan panin thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute ang peikhiet nading thu pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Joshua in, “Jordan panin hing peikhie un,” ci-in siempute thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo siempute, Jordan laikim pan peikhie-in, siempute’ ketaw in leigaw a tot ciengun, Jordan tuite a luon ngaina bangin a mun ciet vuah luongkia-in a masa lai bangin a piau zosie-ah a let hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hla masa a ni sawm ni-in Jordan panin mite pei to-in Jericho ni suona lam gamgi tunga om Gilgal ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jordan pana a puoh uh suongtum sawm le nite, Joshua in Gilgal-ah phut a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-te kungah, “Mai lam hunah na tate un a pate kungah, ‘Tam suongtumte bang a cinopna ahei?’ ci-in a dawh ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Leigaw tungah Israel-te pei-in tam Jordan kantan uhi,’ ci-in na tate na theisah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen eite i galkai zawh masangsie-un, Topa na Pasien un a na kansah San Tuipi tunga a bawl bangin, Topa na Pasien un na kantan zawh masangsie-un Jordan tuite a kangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua khu Topa’ khut thahat mama hi, ci-in leitung mi zosie in a thei nading le Topa na Pasien uh na giin tawntung nading uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan nitumna gal khat a om Amor-te’ kumpi zosie le tuipi gei-a om Canaan-te’ kumpi zosie in Israel-te in a kantan zaw masang amate adingin Jordan tuite Topa in a kansahna thu a zah ciengun a lung uh kie a, Israel-te ziehin lungtawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum hunin Topa in Joshua kungah, “Meituh suong nam bawl inlen Israel-te a ni veina a tep tanpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in meituh suong nam bawlin Gibeath-haaraloth ah Israel-te’ tep a tanpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joshua in a tep uh a tanna thu tam bang ahi hi: Egypt pan a peikhiet zaw ciengun senel gam tawnin a khuolzin hun sungun pasal galhang zosie a si sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A peikhie mi zosie a tep uh a kitan sieng zo vangin senel gam tawnin Egypt panin a khuolzin hun sung vua a suoh mi zosie a tep uh kitan nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel-te in Topa’ thu a ngai lona ziehun Egypt pana a peikhie minam buppi le galhang mite a si sieng dongun senel gamah kum sawmli sung khuol a zin uhi. A pu a pate uh tungah pieh dinga a ciemsa bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gam a musah lo nadingin amate tungah Topa kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in a tep uh a tanpieh mite pen amau’ tanga ama in a piensah a tate uh ahi hi; bangzieh ahei cile amate lamkalah a tep uh kitan nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A minam bupun a tep uh a kitan zaw ciengin a giephuol ciet vuah a dam masangsie-un a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Joshua kungah, “Tuni-in na kung panun Egypt simmawna ka zielmang zo hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tuni dongin khum mun pen Gilgal kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilgal ah Israel-te giephuol satin a om laitahun tua hla a ni sawm le li ni nitahin Jericho zanglei-ah peisan pawi a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Peisan pawi zaw a zing cieng, khum ni mama-in khum gama a pieng tol saw lo moh le bukan a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum gama piengte a neh ni-un manna a om nawn sih a, tuaci’n khum kumin Canaan leitanga pieng ante a ne ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jericho khuo gei-ah Joshua a tun ciengin a khuodah leh, a khut sungah namsau dawsa-in ama’ mai-a a ding mi khat a mu hi. Ama kungah Joshua pei-in, “Nang ko pawl na hiei, ahi sihle ka langte’ pawl na hiei,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “ Koima’ pawl ka hi sih hi; Topa galkapte’ galkapmangpa dinga ang pei ka hi hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Joshua lei-ah bawhsuhin bie a, ama kungah, “Ka Topa in a nasempa keima bang ei sawl nuom na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa galkapte’ galkapmangpa in Joshua kungah, “Na keng panin na kedap sutdawh in, azieh pen na dinna mun a siengtho ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tua ma bangin Joshua a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Israel-te ziehin Jericho kulpi a sunglam le a pulam kikhacip hi; koima pusuoh thei lo, sungtum thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Joshua kungah, “En vawi, na khut sungah a kumpipa le a galhangte tawh Jericho khuo kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuopi kimvelin pei-in galhang zosie in khuopi khatvei kimvel ding uhi. Tua bangin ni guh sung na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempu sagi in thuciemna singkuong mai-ah tuutang ki pengkul sagi tawi ding uhi. A ni sagi ni-in khuopi sagi vei kimvelin siempute in pengkul tum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuutang ki sawtveipi a gin sah ciengun, tua pengkul gin na zah behun nahpi tahin mi zosie a awng ding uhi; tuale khuopi kulpi cimzanin a mailam ciet vuah mi zosie tangtahin a pei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Nun tapa Joshua in siempute hlanin a kung vuah, “Thuciemna singkuong zawng unlen, Topa thuciemna singkuong mai-ah siempu sagi in tua tuutang ki pengkul sagite tawisah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in mite mai-ah, “Mai nawt unlen khuopi kimkotin pei un; Topa’ thuciemna singkuong mai-ah hiem tawi mite peisah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joshua in mite a thupiehsa bangin Topa mai-ah tuutang ki pengkul a tawi siempu sagite madawhin pengkul a tum vua, Topa’ thuciemna singkuong in amate nua a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pengkul tum siempute mai-ah hiem tawite a pei uhi; pengkulte a kitumsuoh laitahin thukham singkuong nua-ah nuadalte a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua in mite tungah tam bangin thu a pie hi: “A awng dinga kang gen ni masang na awng sih ding vua, na aw uh kizasah loin kam khat beh na ham sih ding uhi. Tua ciengin na awng ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ thukham singkuong in khatvei khuopi a kimvel hi; giephuol-ah a kilekia vua, tuanah a zan gie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin zingmawngin Joshua tho bai a, siempute in Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa’ thuciemna singkuong mai-a a pei tuutang ki pengkul sagi a tawi siempu sagite peisuohin pengkul a tumsuoh uhi. A mai vuah hiem tawite pei-in, pengkul a kitum suoh laitahin Topa’ thuciemna singkuong nua-ah nuadalte a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni ni ni-in khatvei khuopi a kimvel vua, tua ciengin giephuol-ah a kilekia uhi. Tua bangin ni guh sung a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ni sagi ni khuova patin tho bai-in tua bang ma-in khuopi sagivei a kimvel uhi. Khum ni behin khuopi kimkotah sagivei a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A sagiveina ah siempute in pengkul a tum ciengun Joshua in mite kungah, “Awng un! Azieh pen Topa in na tung vuah khuopi ang pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuopi le a sunga om zosie Topa tungah biehna-in kisusie ding hi. Ama in i sawl uh kamtaite a na phuol ziehin numei pahtat Rahab le ama tawh a inn sunga om teng beh hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Suhsiet dinga ki-apsa na khatpo deigaw-in la-in, Israel-te’ giephuol kisietna suohsahin amate tungah lungkhamna na tunsah khah lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin ngun le kham zosie, le sumsan le sia tawh kibawl vante Topa adingin a siengtho hi. Topa’ gou kholna-ah tuate tung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite awngin pengkulte kitum hi. Mite in pengkul awging a zah behun nahpi tahin a awng uleh kulpi a cimzan hi; tuaci’n amate mai cietah mi zosie tangtahin khuopi sungah lutin khuopi a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in khuopi sunga om nupi, pasal, khanglai le tehsie, bawng tang, tuu le laa zosie namsau tawh a thatgam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua in khum gam a kandap mi nite kungah, “Numei pahtat nu’ inn ah va pei ta unlen, ama tunga na ciemsa bangun numei le ama tawh kisai zosie hing peipi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n thukan tangvalte va tumin Rahab, a nu le a pa, a sanggamte le ama tawh kisai zosie, inn sung panin a peipi uhi. Numei nu’ innkuonpi zosie a zawpi vua, Israel-te’ giephuol pulamah a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in a khuopi le a sunga om zosie mei tawh halin Topa’ goukholna sungah ngun le kham, sumsan le sia tawh kibawl vante a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin numei pahtat Rahab, a innkuonpi le ama tawh kisai zosie, Joshua in a hingkhawi hi. Tua huna kipanin Israel gam sungah tua nu’ innkuonte a teng uhi. Azieh pen ama nu in Jericho khuo thu a kandap dinga Joshua in a sawl kamtaite a phuoldap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in tami kiciemna gen a, “Tami Jericho khuopi lamkia ding a hanciem poma Topa mai-ah kisamsie taheh!. Ama in a tacil luong tawh a khuombul phut ding a, a ta tumpen luong tawh khuopi tunkotte phut ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Joshua ompi hi; tuale gam sung zosie-ah a min a thang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanle a ki-ap vante tawh kisai-in Israel-te tam bangin a zuoutat uhi: Judah minam Zerah’ tapa Zabdi, a tapa Carmi, a tapa Achan in a ki-ap vante pawlkhat a la hi; tuale Israel-te tungah Topa’ lungthahna a kuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua in Jericho panin Bethel ni suona lam Beth-aven gei-a om Ai khuo ah mi sawlin amate kungah, “Peito unlen gam va endap ta un,” a ci hi. Tua mite peito-in Ai khuo a endap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate Joshua kungah kilekia-in a kungah, “Mi zosie kuonto kul lo hi; mi tulni ahi sihle mi tul thum kim khat kuonto-in Ai khuo simsah lel in. Mi tawmno khat ahi bo ziehun khum sungah mi buppi gimsah da in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum munah mi tul thum bang a kuonto uhi; tuale Ai mite mai-ah amate a taimang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ai khuo mite in sawmthum le guh bang a that vua, khuopi kulpi pulam panin Shebarim mun dongah delin kumsuhna munah a that uhi. Mite lungkie-in a lungsim uh tui a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in a puonte ehmalin nitah dongin Topa’ singkuong mai-ah ama le Israel upate tuolah a khupbawh uhi, tuale amate in a lutang uh leivui a buoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua in, “Ah, Topa Pasien! Ko ei susie ding Amor-te’ khut sunga ei pie dingin bang dinga tam mite Jordan galkhatah ei peipi poma na hei? Jordan galkhatah a teng dingin a lungkim hi tazaw mai uleng izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, a galte kung panin Israel-te a kilekia ta uhi. Tu-in ke’n bang gen thei ding ka hei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Canaan-te le tam gama teng mi zosie-in tam thu a za ding vua, tuaci’n amate in kote ei imtawmin leitung panin ka min uh ei phietpieh ding uhi. Tua ciengin a lien mama nangma’ min bang na law ta diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Joshua kungah, “Dingto vawi! Bang dinga lei lahah khupbawh na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel a khiel zo ta uhi; amate tunga ka pieh ka thuciemnate a palsat zo uhi. Amate in a ki-ap vante pawlkhat a la uhi; amate in gu-in a zuou gamtat vua, a neisate lah vuah tua vante a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel-te in a galte uh nang zo lo uhi; amate pen suhsiet dinga ki-ap van khat a suo zo tah ziehun a galte masangah a nuakia uhi. Na lah vuah a ki-ap vante na suhsiet sih uleh kang ompi nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mite na siensuo khu zom inlen, ‘Zing cieng adingin no le no kisiensuo ciet un; azieh pen Topa , Israel Pasien in, ‘Israel-te aw, na lah vuah a ki-ap vante om hi; note lah panin a ki-ap vante na lah masangsie-un na galte uh mai-ah na ding zo sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ziehin zing ciengin na minam namun nang pei ding uhi. Topa in a lah minam sung panin a bebe-in ang pei ding hi. Topa in a lah a be sung panin a innkuonkuonin ang pei ding hi. Topa in a lah a innkuon sung panin a mimi-in ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ki-ap vante tawh a kimanton pa, a neisa zosie tawh mei-in kihal ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ thuciemna palsatin Israel-te lahah zum huoi-in ama gam ta hi,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawngin Joshua tho bai-in, Israel-te a minam namin peipi a, Judah minam kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in Judah be a nai-ah peipi a, Zerah-te be kila hi; tuale ama in a innkuonkuonin Zerah-te be peipi a, Zabdi kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a innkuonpite khat tata-in peipi a, Judah minam Zerah’ tapa Zabdi, a tapa Carmi, a tapa Achan kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in Achan kungah, “Ka tapa aw, Israel Topa Pasien min thangsah inlen, ama kungah na mawna pulah in. Tu-in bang ahiei na bawl kei ei gen inlen, bangma ei pha sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Achan in Joshua dawng a, “Tua khu aman ahi hi; Israel Topa Pasien tungah ka maw zo ta hi. Ka gamtatna tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Shinar panin vanlahte lahah puon hoi khat le shekel zani a khai ngun, le shekel sawmnga a khai kham tawn khat ka mu ciengin ipla-in ka lakha ma hi. Tu-in tuate ka puonbuh sung lei lahah kiphuol a, a nei lamah ngunte kikoi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in kamtaite sawlin a puonbuh lamah a tai uhi; tuale a puonbuh sung lei nei-ah a ngun na kiphuol tahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Puonbuh panin tua vante ladawhin Joshua le Israel-te zosie kungah a peipi uhi; tuale amate in Topa mai-ah tuate a thezah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua le ama tawh a om Israel-te zosie in Zerah’ tapa Achan le a ngun, a puon, a kham tawn, a tapate, a tanute, a bawng, a laa, a tuu, a puonbuh le a nei vannuoi a la uhi; tuale amate in Achor Kuom dongah tuate a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joshua in, “Bang dinga kote tunga gimna ei tut na hei? Tu ni-in Topa in na tungah gimna ang tungsah ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Israel-te zosie in suong tawh Achan a seplia uhi; amate in tua teng mei tawh halin suong tawh a sep vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale a tungah suongtum lompi a sungvum vua, tuni dongin a omlai hi. Tua ciengin Topa’ lungthahna a dai hi. Tua ahi ziehin tuni dongin tua mun Achor Kuom kici hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua kungah Topa in, “Zau sinlen lungkie sin. Galkap zosie zawpi inlen Ai khuo-ah tu-in peito in. En in, nangma tungah Ai kumpipa le a mite, a khuopi le a leitang kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jericho le a kumpipa tungah na bawl bangin Ai le a kumpipa tungah zong na bawl ding hi; van kinuasiete le a ganhingte beh galvan lahin noma dingin na la ding uhi. Khuopi nua lamah a sim ding na koidap ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ai khuo sim dingin mite a kuonto uhi. Joshua in galhang mi tul sawmthum teelin zanin sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tua khuopi sim dingin a nua lamah na buhdap ding uhi; khuopi panin gamla pei sih un, hinanle na unpi-un a kigingsa-in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei le ka ompi mi zosie in khuopi kang nai ding vua, a masa lai bangin ei do dinga ang kuon ciengun amate mai panin ka na tai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuopi panin amate ka nawdawh masangun amate in ei del ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile, ‘A masa lai bangin i kung panun amate a tai uhi,’ ci ding uhi. Amate kung panin ka tai laitahun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />na kibuhna mun panun ang pei-in khuopi na la ding uhi; bang ding ahei cile Topa na Pasien un na khut sung vuah amate ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuopi na lah zaw ciengun Topa’ thupiehsa bangin gamta-in mei tawh khuopi na hal ding uhi; thei un, thu kang pie zo uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in amate a sawldawh hi; a kibuh nading munah amate pei-in Ai ni tumna lam, Bethel le Ai kikalah a pang uhi; ahi vangin tua zanin giephuol ah Joshua a gieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zingmawngin Joshua tho bai-in mite khawm a, mite mai-ah Israel upate tawh Ai-ah a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama tawh a omton galkap zosie a pei to vua, khuopi mai nehin Ai lei lulam pangah giephuol a sat vua, Ai le a kikal vuah luihawm khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in mi tulnga bang peipi-in khuopi nitumna lam Bethel le Ai kikalah a kibudap sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n galkapte, khuopi leilu lamah galkap phuolpi koi-in, khuopi nitumna lamah nuadalte koi hi. Ahi vangin khum zanin kuom sungah Joshua a gieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ai kumpipa in tam a mu ciengin ama le ama’ mite zosie le khumi khuo-a teng zosie, zingmawngin a thobai vua, Arabah tawh a kimaingat ahi kimutuona ding munah Israel-te tawh gal kido dingin mallangin a kuon uhi; ahi vangin ama do dingin khuopi nua lamah a pangdap mi a op lam ama in thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mai vuah Joshua le Israel-te zosie a lel kipangin senel gam manaw-in a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate del dingin khuopi sunga om mi zosie kikai khawmin Joshua a del uleh khuopi pan amate a na kihemmang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ai khuo le Bethel khuo sungah Israel-te a del lo pasal khat beh a om sih hi; amate in khuopi kot honsa-in nuasie-in, Israel-te a nuadel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Joshua kungah, “Na khut sunga om namsau Ai khuo lam ngatin zah in; azieh pen na khut sungah tua khuo kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Joshua in khuopi lamngatin a khut sunga om namsau a zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A khut a zah behin a buhdap galkapte a opna mun panun a dingkhie vua, mailam nawtin a nawtai mama uhi. Khuopi sungah lutin a la vua, tua khuopi mei tawh a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ai mite in a nua-et uleh vantung lamah khuopi meikhu kitungto a mu uhi. Tam lam ahi a, khum lam ahi zongin a tai thei nawn sih uhi. Azieh pen senel gama a tai mite kinua hei-in a delte a do uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A budapte in khuopi a lah zawhna ule Joshua le Israel-te zosie in a kitungto khuopi meikhu a mu ciengun kilehei-in Ai mite a vatgawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate do dingin khuopi panin adangte a kuonto uhi; tuaci’n Israel-te in pawlkhat langkhatah, pawlkhat adang khatah a kui-im uhi. Tuale amate a hinglai le a suohta khat zong om lo za dongin Israel-te in a vatmai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ai kumpipa a hingin kiman a, Joshua kungah kipeipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel-te in senal gam zanga amate a delna Ai khuo mi zosie thatin, namsau tawh a unpi vua a sigam zaw ciengun Ai khuo-ah Israel-te zosie kilekia-in namsau tawh tua khuopi a sim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khum ni-a a si Ai khuo mi zosie numei le pasal a kigawmin tulsawm le tulni pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Ai khuomi zosie a tha sieng masangin Joshua in a namsau lapna a khut a dawhkia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in Joshua a thupieh dung zui-in, Israel-te in ganhingte le khuopi sunga van kinuasiete beh gal vanlahin a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in Ai khuopi hal a, tua khuopi pen tuni-a bangin buathah kholna suohsah den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuale ama in nitah dongin sing tungah Ai kumpipa a khai hi; tuale ni a tum ciengin Joshua in thu pie-in, amate in sing tung panin a luong a khiesuh vua, khuopi kulkotpi lutna-ah pai-in a tungah suongtum lompi a cieng vua, tuni dongin tua suongcien a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in Israel Pasien Topa adingin Ebal muol tungah maitam khat lam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa’ nasem Moses in Israel-te a thupiehsa bangin Moses’ thukham laibu sungah, “A tungah sia vanzah a kizang lo, suongtum tawh a kikheng lo maitam,” ci-in kigiel hi; tua tungah Topa adingin meihal biehnate pie-in thunuam biehpiehnate a lui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua munah Joshua in Israel-te mitmu-in suong tungah Moses gielsa thukham a tei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel mite thupha a pieh thei nadingun Topa’ nasem Moses thupiehsa bangin Israel mi zosie pemta hile tuolsung hile, a upate uh, a uliente ule a thukhente utawh, Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo Levi siempute mai, thuciemna singkuong langkhat, Gerizim Muol mai lamah mi alang, Ebal Muol mai lamah mi alang a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in thukham laibu sunga kigiel thuphate le samsietnate, thukham sunga om kammal zosie a unpi-in a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Joshua in Moses’ thupieh kammal zosie Israel mi honpi zosie, numeite, nausente le amate lahah a teng pemtate zosie mai-ah a sim lo khat zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Jordan galkhatah a om muoltung gam le lei ngiemna gam Tuipi lien dung peisuoh Lebanon donga teng Hit-te, Amor-te, Canaan-te, Periz-te, Hiv-te le Jebus-te in tam thu a zah ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua le Israel-te sim dingin lungsim kikhatin a kisutuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Gibeon-a teng mite in Jericho le Ai tunga Joshua bawlsate a zah ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amate lam panin tam bangin a solbawl uhi: Amate pei-in lam-ante guongin, a laate adingin a siesa ip le a paatsa, a lui a kiphaw lenggazu-umte a guong vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a keng vuah a kiphaw, a paatsa kedapte bulin a paatsa puonte a sil uhi; a an zosie uzong a gawta le a apkai vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gilgal giephuola om Joshua kungah pei-in ama le Israel-te tungah, “Kote pen a gamlapi pana ang pei ka hi uhi; tuaci’n tuni-in kote tawh thukimna khat hing bawl un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle Israel-te in Hiv-te kungah, “Kote lahah a teng mite na hi kha thei ding uhi. Tua bang hi mawh leh note tawh thukimna bang ka ci bawl thei ding uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in Joshua kungah, “Na nasemte ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi. Tuale Joshua in, “No koite na hi vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in, “ Topa na Pasien uh’ min zalin na nasemte a gamla mama gam pana ang pei ka hi uhi; azieh pen ama’ thu le Egypt gam sunga a sepkhiet zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />le Jordan galkhata om Amor kumpi nite ahi Ashtaroth-a a teng Heshbon kumpi Sihon le Bashan kumpi Og tunga a sepsa zosie a kigenna ka za zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka upate ule ka gam vua ka tenpi uh mi zosie in kote kungah, ‘Na khuolzin nading vuah lam-an guong un; amate tawh a kimu dingin pei unlen a kung vuah, “Na nasemte ka hi uhi; tu-in hing pei unlen kote tawh thukimna khat hing bawl un,” va ci ta un,’ ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tanah ka mohte uh om hi. Na kung vua ang haw dinga kang din khiet ni uh, khuolzin lam-an dinga ka guon lai-un a lumlai a, hizongle tu-in en un, gawta-in a apkai sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami lenggatui savun bungte zong ka thun patun a tha ahi a, tu-in a sie sieng ta hi; tami ka puonte ule ka kedapte uzong lam saupi kang peina vuah a siepaat sieng ta hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n makaite-in a lam-an uh a ne vua, Topa tung panin lamlahna a ngen sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale Joshua in amate a hinkhawi nading kilemna thuciem a bawl hi; tuale amate tungah mihonpi makaite a kiciem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hizongle amate tawh thukimna a bawl zaw uh nithum a cin ciengin, amate pen a vengte ahi lam ule amate lahah a tengte ahi lam a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te dingkhie-in a ni thum ni-in a khuopite vuah a tung uhi. A khuopite uh pen Gibeon, Chephirah, Beeroth le Kiriath-jearim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin mihonpi makaite in Topa , Israel Pasien’ min tawh a tung vuah kiciemna a nei zo ziehun Israel-te in amate a do sih uhi. Tua ciengin mihon zosie makaite tungah a phun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanle makai zosie in mihonpi zosiete tungah, “ Topa , Israel Pasien’ minin a tung vuah i kiciem zo ta vua, tu-in amate i sukha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate tunga i bawl ding uh tam ahi hi: Eite in amate tunga i bawl uh thuciemna ziehin eite tungah lungthahna ang tun lo nadingin amate i hingsah ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Makaite in a kung vuah, “Amate hingsah un,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n amate tawh kisai makaite khensatsa bangin mihonpi zosie adingin sing suite le tui tawite a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua in amate hlanin a kung vuah, “Kote lahah teng napi bang dingin, ‘Na kung panin a gamlapi-ah ka teng uhi,’ ci-in ei sol na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in samsiet thuoh na hi vua, note lahah mi pawlkhat a tawntungin sila, ka Pasien’ inn adingin sing suite le tui tawite na hi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in Joshua dawngin, “Bangzieh ahei cile Topa na Pasien un ama’ nasem Moses tungah gam buppi nang hing pie-in na mai panin gam sunga teng mi zosie a suhsiet tahtah nading thu a piehna ko na nasemte kungah ei kigen hi. Note ziehin ka si ding uh ka zau mama vua, tuaci’n tam bangin ka na bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in kote pen na khut sunga om ka hi uhi: Na muna-ah a hoi le a man na sah bangin ka tung vuah ei bawl in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in amate adingin tam bangin a bawl hi: Ama in Israel-te panin amate a hunkhie hi; amate a that sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua ni-in Joshua in mihonpite ading le ama in a teel nading munah Topa’ maitam ading singtomte le tuitawite suohsah a, tuni dongin a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua in Ai khuo a lah dan, tua khuo a suhmaimang dan, Jericho le a kumpite tunga a bawl dan teng le Gibeon-a tengte in Israel-te tawh kilemna bawlin amate lahah a opton dan teng uh Jerusalem Kumpi Adoni-zedek in a zah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama zau mama hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Gibeon pen kumpi khuopite khat ma bangin khuopi lien khat ahi a, Ai khuo sangin gol zaw-in a mite zosie galhang vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jerusalem Kumpipa Adoni-zedek in Hebron Kumpipa Hoham, Jarmuth Kumpipa Piram, Lachish Kumpipa Japhia, le Eglon Kumpipa Debir-te kungah kamtai sawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hing kuonto-in ei panpi unlen, Gibeon va sim ta vai. Azieh pen ama in Joshua le Israel-te tawh kilemna a bawl hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amor kumpi ngate - Jerusalem kumpi, Hebron kumpi, Jarmuth kumpi, Lachish kumpi, Eglon kumpite - in a galkapte uh kaikhawmin a galkap zosie utawh a kuonto vua, Gibeon galah giephuol satin a do uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gibeon-te in Gilgal giephuol-a Joshua kungah kamtai sawlin, “Na nasemte ei nuasie sin; mallang tahin ko kungah hing peito-in ei hunkhie inlen ei panpi in; azieh pen ko ei do dingin muoltung gama teng Amor kumpi zosie ang kikhawm ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gilgal panin ama le a galkap zosie le a thahat galhangte zosie tawh Joshua a kuonto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Joshua kungah, “Amate giing sin, azieh pen na khut sungah amate kang pie zo hi; na mai-ah amate khat beh a ding zo sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in Gilgal panin zan tungtawn peito-in thakhatthu-in amate a busim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te mai-ah Amor-te a zausisah a, Gibeon-ah nasie tahin amate that gamin Beth-horon katona lamah a delto vua, Azekah le Makkedah dongah a vatgawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel-te mai-ah amate a taimang laitah, Beth-horon kumsuhna-ah a peisuh laitahun van panin Topa in gieltang golpite Azekah khuo cieng dong, amate tungah kiesahin amate a si uhi; Israel-te in namsau tawh a tha sangin tua gielpi zieha a si mi tamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te khut sungah Amor-te a pieh ni-in Joshua in Topa hopi hi; tuale ama in Israel-te muna-ah, “Ni aw, nang Gibeon-ah, Hla aw, nang Aijalon kuomah khawlden in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale minamte in a galte uh tungah phu a lah zo masangsie-un, ni ding denin hla zong a khawlden hi. Jashar laibu sungah tami thu kigiel hi lo amah? Van kimlai-ah ni khawl a, ni khat bup bang a tumpah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua masang hitale tua hun zaw hitale Topa in mihing khat’ thu a ngai tua ni bang nidang om ngai lo hi; azieh pen Topa in Israel-te dingin gal dopieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in ama tawh a om Israel-te zosie tawh Gilgal-a giephuol-ah a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin tami kumpi ngate a taimang vua, Makkedah leihawm sungah a kiphuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Joshua kungah, “Makkedah leihawm sunga kiphuol kumpi ngate kimu zo ta hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joshua in, “Leihawm kam sungah suongtum golpite lia unlen a cing ding mi koi un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ahi vangin khum sungah om sih un; na galte del unlen, a nualam panin sim un. A khuopi sung vuah lutsah sih un, azieh pen Topa na Pasien un na khut sung vuah amate ang pie zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joshua le Israel-te in a sigam sieng dongun amate tampi tah a thazaw uh cieng, khuopi muonhuoi sungah a suohta lai mite a lutzaw ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Makkedah giephuol-a Joshua kungah mi zosie dam le bihin a kilekia uhi; Israel-te langkhatah a kamkeh ngam koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in, “Leihawm kam hong unlen, tua leihawm panin kumpi ngate ka kungah hing peipi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in tua bangin bawlin leihawm panin kumpi ngate, Jerusalem kumpi, Hebron kumpi, Jarmuth kumpi, Lachish kumpi, le Eglon kumpite, ama kungah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in Joshua kungah kumpi ngate a peipi zaw ciengun, Joshua in Israel-te zosie hlanin ama tawh a kuonton galhang makaite kungah, “Keima ei nai unlen tam kumpite ngawngah na keng uh ngam un,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin amate in zong nai-in a ngawng vuah a keng a ngam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joshua in amate kungah, “Zau sih unlen, lungkie sih un; thahat unlen, hang un; azieh pen Topa in na do uh na gal zosie uh tungah tam bangin a bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in amate satlia-in sisah a, singkung nga tungah a khai hi. Nitah dongin sing tungah amate a khai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni a tum ciengin Joshua in thu pie a, singtung panin amate a lakhie vua, a kiphuolna ngai uh leihawm sungah a pai uhi; amate in leihawm kam sungah suongtum golpite a koi vua, tuni dongin tua suongtumte a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khum ni-in Joshua in Makkedah khuo la-in, namsau tawh tua khuo le a kumpipa a vatmai hi; ama in tua khuo sunga om zosie sumaimang hi; koima khat beh a hen sih hi. Ama in Jericho kumpipa tunga a bawl bangin Makkedah kumpipa tungah zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua le a op tonpi Israel-te zosie, Makkedah panin Libnah-ah a peisuoh vua, Libnah a sim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te khut sungah tua khuo le a kumpipa zong a pie hi; tuale ama in tua khuo le a sunga om mi zosie namsau tawh vatmai a, koima khat beh hen nei loin Jericho khuopi tunga a bawl bangin a kumpipa tungah a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua banah Joshua in ama tawh a omton Israel-te tawh Libnah panin a pei suoh vua, Lachish imtawmin a bulu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te khut sungah Lachish pie a, ama in a ni ni ni-in Lachish la a, Libnah a bawl bangin tua khuo le a sunga om mi zosie namsau tawh a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin Lachish a hu dingin Gezer Kumpipa Horam kuonto hi; tuale Joshua in ama le a mi zosie khat beh hen nei loin namsau tawh a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lachish panin Joshua le Israel-te zosie pei suohin, Eglon khuo imtawmin a bulu uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuale khum ni ma-in tua khuo a la vua, namsau tawh a vatmai uhi; Lachish a bawl bangin khum ni ma-in tua khuo sunga om zosie nasie tahin ama in a sumaimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te zosie tawh Eglon panin Hebron-ah Joshua a peito hi. Amate in tua khuo bulu-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a la vua, a kumpipa, a khuopite le a sunga om mi zosie namsau tawh a vatmai hi; amate in Eglon tunga a bawl bangin tua khuo le a sunga om mi zosie a sumaimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel zosie tawh Debir-ah Joshua kilekia-in tua khuo a bulu vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />ama in a kumpipa le a khuo zosie tawh tua khuo a la hi; amate in namsau tawh amate a vatmai vua, khuo sunga om mi zosie a sumaimang uhi; ama in koima hen a nei sih hi; ama in Hebron le Libnah le a kumpipa tunga a bawl bangin Debir le a kumpipa tungah zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in gam buppi, muoltung gam, Negeb gam, leingiem gam, gamken teng le a kumpi zosie a zo sieng hi; ama in koima khat zong a hen sih a, ahi vangin Topa , Israel Pasien in a thupieh bangin a husang zosie a sumaimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kadesh-barnea panin Gaza cieng dong, le Goshen gam zosie Gibeon cieng dong, Joshua in a zo gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Israel-te’ Topa Pasien in Israel-te adingin gal a dopieh ziehin Joshua in hun khat sungin tam kumpi zosie le a leitang uh a la sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in ama tawh a omton Israel-te zosie tawh Gilgal-a a giephuol vuah a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hazor Kumpipa Jabin in tam thu a zah ciengin, Madon Kumpipa Jobab kung, Shimron kumpipa kung, Achshaph kumpipa kung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />leilu lam muol tung gama om kumpite kung, Chinneroth leitaw lama om Arabah gam sung, le lei ngiemna mun nitumna lama om Naphoth-dor gam sunga om kumpite kung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nisuona le nitumna lama om Canaan-te, Amor-te, Hit-te, Periz-te, muoltung gama om Jebus-te, Mizpah gam Hermon nei-a om Hiv-te kungah thu a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate tuipi gei-a senel bangin a galkap honpi, galkap honte zosie le a tam mama sakolte le leengte tawh a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami kumpite zosie in amau’ galkapte gawmin Israel-te do dingin a kuon vua, Merom lui-ah giephuol a satton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Joshua kungah, “Amate giing sin, azieh pen zing cieng tu hunin amate a unpi-un a sisa-in Israel-te tungah ka pie ding hi; a sakolte uh a kapzahui na vatsan ding vua, a leengte uh mei tawh na hal ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua zong a galkap zosie tawh thakhatin Merom lui gei-a amate kungah pei-in a va sim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Sidon Lien le Misrephoth-maim cieng dong, le nisuona lam Mizpeh kuom dong amate a del Israel-te’ khut sungah amate a pie hi. A suohta khat beh a om nawn lo dongin a that gam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa thupiehsa bangin Joshua in amate tungah a bawl hi; ama in a sakolte uh a kapzahui vatsan piehin a leengte uh mei tawh a halpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum hunin Joshua kiheikia-in Hazor la a, namsau tawh a kumpipa a vat hi. Khum hun masangin Hazor khuo pen tua kumpipa gamte zosie’ lutang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum sunga teng zosie namsau tawh vatmai-in a sumaimang uhi; a husang thei khat beh kihingkhawi lo a, tuale ama in mei tawh Hazor a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa’ nasem Moses in a thupiehsa bangin Joshua in tua kumpite opna khuo teng le a kumpi teng uh la a, namsau tawh vatmai-in a sumaimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle Joshua in a na haltum Hazor simlo, muol tunga khuopite khat zong Israel-te in hal lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-te in galvan lah dingin tami khuopite sunga van kinuasiete le ganhingte a la uhi; ahi vangin amate a suhsiet masangsie-un namsau tawh a vatmai vua, a husang thei khat zong a hen sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in a nasempa Moses a thupieh ma bangin Moses in zong Joshua thu piesawn a, tuaci’n Joshua zong tua bang ma-in a gamta hi; Topa in Moses a thupieh zosie Joshua in sep loin a nuasie khat zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in tam gam zosie a la hi: Muoltung gam, Negeb gam zosie, Goshen gam zosie, gam niem gam le Arabah gam, Israel muoltung gam le a ngiemna gam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Seir lama kihlungto Halak Muol panin Hermon Muol nei Lebanon kuoma om Baal-gad cieng dong a la hi. Ama in a kumpi zosie uh man a, vat gawpin a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua kumpite zosie le Joshua sauveipi a kido hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gibeon-a teng Hiv-te longal Israel-te tawh kilemna a bawl khuopi khat zong om lo hi; tua khuote zosie gal sunga a lah uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bang lienin amate kihepi loin a kisuhsiet kilkel nading le a amate a cigam thei nadingun Israel-te tawh kido dinga ang kuon thei nading uh pen Topa’ nasep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum hunin Joshua pei-in muoltung gam, Hebron, Debir, Anab le Judah muoltung gam zosie pan le Israel muoltung gam zosie panin Anak-te a notmang hi; Joshua in a khuopite utawh amate a susiemang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel-te’ gam sungah Anak-te khat beh om nawn lo hi; Gaza, Gath, le Ashdod sung behah pawl khat omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Moses tunga a gensa zosie bangin Joshua in gam buppi a la hi; Joshua in amau’ minam tanh tawh kizui-in Israel-te tungah a luo dingun gamh-in a pie hi. Tuale tua gamah gal a veng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nisuona lam Jordan galkhat, Arnon Lui panin Hermon Muol cieng dong, Arabah nisuona lam zosie, tam teng pen tu-in Israel-te in zo-in a lahsa uh kumpite’ gam ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Heshbon-a teng Amor-te Kumpipa Sihon, Arnon Lui monga om Aroer pan, le kuom laikim panin Gilead phallang khat ahi Ammon-te gamgi Jabbok gun cieng dong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />le Arabah panin Chinneroth Tuipi nisuona lam, le Beth-jeshimoth peina lamah Si Tuipi ahi Arabah tuipi dong, le a hlanglam-ah Pisgah gamken bul dong ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale Ashtaroth le Edrei-a teng Rephaim-te kumpi nukhiate lahah khat ahi Bashan kumpipa Og ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Hermon Muol le Salecah, le Bashan gam zosie, Geshur-te le Maacath-te’ gamgi cieng dong, le Gilead gam phallang khat panin Heshbon Kumpipa Sihon’ gamgi cieng dong a uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa’ nasem Moses le Israel-te in amate a zo uhi; tuale Topa’ nasem Moses in Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte tungah amau’ tan dingin leitang a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam teng pen Jordan nitumna lam panga Joshua le Israel-te in a na zawsa kumpi gamte hi a, Lebanon kuom sung Baal-gad panin Seir lama kihlungto Halak Muol cieng dong hi a, (Israel minamte amau’ tanh ding tawh kizui-in Joshua in a luo ding vua a pieh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />muoltung gam sung, lei ngiemna gam sung, Arabah gam sung, muolpang gamken teng, senel gam sung, le Negeb gam sunga om Hit-te, Amor-te, Canaan-te, Periz-te, Hiv-te, le Jebus-te’ gamte ahi hi):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jericho kumpi khat, Bethel kunga Ai kumpi khat
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem kumpi khat, Hebron kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jarmuth kumpi khat, Lachish kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eglon kumpi khat, Gezer kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Debir kumpi khat, Geder kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hormah kumpi khat, Arad kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Libnah kumpi khat, Adullam kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Makkedah kumpi khat, Bethel kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tappuah kumpi khat, Hepher kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aphek kumpi khat, Lasharon kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Madon kumpi khat, Hazar kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimron-meron kumpi khat, Achshaph kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Taanach kumpi khat, Megiddo kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kedesh kumpi khat, Carmel gam sunga Jokneam kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naphath-dor sunga Dor kumpi khat, Galilee sunga Goiim kumpi khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tirzah kumpi khat, a unpi-in kumpi sawmthum le khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Joshua vuoi-in a kum a tam mama ta hi; tuale Topa in ama kungah, “Nang lah vuoi-in na kum a tam ta a, gam lah ding tampitah omlai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gam lah ding a omlai tam teng ahi hi: Philistia gam sung zosie le Geshur gam zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Egypt nisuona Shihor panin leilu lama Ekron gamgi dong, tua pen Canaan-te’ gamin kiciemte hi; Gaza, Ashdod, Ashkelon, Gath, le Ekron gamte a uh Philistia mi nga a om hi) le Avvim gam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />leitaw lama Canaan-te’ leitang zosie, le Sidon-te’ gam ahi Mearah gam, Amor-te’ gamgi ahi Aphek cieng dong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />le Gebal-te’ leitang, le Lebanon gam zosie, nisuona lamah Hermon Muol nei-a Baal-gad panin Lebo-hamath cieng dong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lebanon panin Misrephoth-maim cieng dong, Sidon-te zosie nangawn ahi hi. Kei mama in Israel-te mai panin amate ka notmang ding hi; nang kang thupiehsa bangin Israel-te tungah a luo dingun leitang beh hawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in minam kuo le Manasseh minam alangte tungah a luo dingun tam leitang hawm in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Manasseh minam alang dang khatte tawh Reuben-te le Gad-te in Topa’ nasem Moses in amate a piehsa bangin nisuona lam Jordan galkhatah gamh nga zo uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Arnon Lui monga om Aroer pan, le kuom laikima om khuopi, le Medeba panin Dibon cieng donga kihlung phei muolzang gam zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />le Ammon-te’ gamgi cieng dong ahi Heshbon-a kumpi a sem Amor-te’ kumpipa Sihon’ khuopite zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead le Geshur-te’ gam le Maacath-te’ gam, le Hermon Muol zosie, le Salecah dong Bashan gam zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ashtaroth le Edrei-a kumpi sem Bashan gam sunga Og kumpi gam zosie (Rephaim-a a suohtate lahah a ma beh om hi); Moses in tam teng zo-in a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongle Israel-te in Geshur-te ahi a, Maacath-te ahi zongin notmang lo hi; ahi vangin tu-ni dongin Israel-te lahah Geshur-te le Maacath-te a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses in Levi minamte tung behah gouluo pie lo hi; ama in a kung vuah a gensa bangin Israel-te’ Topa Pasien tunga kipie meihal biehnate pen amau’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in Reuben minamte tungah amau’ be tawh kizui-in gouluo a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau’ gouluo pen Arnon Lui gei-a om Aroer pan, le kuom laizanga om khuopi, le Medeba gei-a muolzang zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heshbon, le muolzang tunga om a khuopite zosie; Dibon, Bamoth-baal, Beth-baal-meon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jahaz, Kademoth, Mephaath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiriathaim, Sibmah, le tua kuom muoltunga om Zereth-Shahar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bethpeor, Pisgah kenpang suh, le Bethjeshimoth ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />muolzang khuopi zosie, le Moses in Midian makaite Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, le Reba, tua gama teng Sihon’ uliente tawh a na zaw ton ahi Heshbon-a kumpi sem Amor mi Kumpi Sihon’ kumpi gam zosie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beor’ tapa, aisan siempa Balaam zong, Israel-te in adang a thate lahah namsau tawh a thatton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Reuben-te’ gamgi pen Jordan le a gunpang ahi hi. Tam pen amau’ be tawh kizui-in a khuopite le a khuoneute tawh Reuben-te’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses in Gad minamte tungah zong amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in gouluo a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau’ gam pen Jazer, le Gilead khuopi zosie, Rabbah nisuona lama om Aroer cieng dong Ammon-te’ leitang phallang khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />le Heshbon panin Ramath-mizpeh le Betonim cieng, le Mahanaim panin Debir gam cieng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />le Beth-haram kuom sungah Beth-nimrah, Succoth, le Zaphon, Heshbon-a kumpi Sihon’ kumpi gam a omlai teng, Jordan le a gunpang teng, Chinnereth Tuipi a niemna lam mong cieng dong, Jordan galkhat nisuona lam dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam pen amau’ be tawh kizui-in a khuopite ule a khuoneute tawh Gad-te’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in Manasseh minam alangte tungah gouluo a pie hi. Amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Manasseh minam alangte tungah kihawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amau’ gam pen Mahanaim panin Bashan gam sung zosie kansanin Bashan kumpi Og’ kumpi gam buppi, le Bashan gam sunga om Jair-te tenna zosie, khuopi sawmguhte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />le Bashan-a Og’ kumpi gam khuopite ahi Gilead alang le Ashtaroth, le Edrei khuopite ahi hi. Tam teng pen amau’ be tawh kizui-in Machir-te alang adingin Manasseh’ tapa Machir mite tungah kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam teng pen Jericho nisuona lam Jordan galkhat, Moab zanglei-ah Moses in a hawm gouluote ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin Levi minamte tungah Moses in gouluo pie lo hi; Israel-te’ Topa Pasien a kung vua a gensa bangin ama pen amau’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen siempu Eleazar in Nun tapa Joshua le Israel minam sunga be lutang teng tunga a hawmpieh Canaan gam sunga Israel-te’ nga gouluote ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minam kuo le alangte adingin Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin aisanna tawh amau’ gouluote kihawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Jordan galkhata minam ni le alangte tungah Moses in gouluo a pie zo ta hi. Hizongle ama in amate lahah Levi-te bangma gouluo pie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Joseph mite pen minam ni-in kikhen a, Manasseh le Ephraim minamte ahi uhi. Khum gam sungah Levi-te ading tanh kipie lo a, ahi vangin tenna ding khuopite le a ganhingte vua dingin lonona gamte kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh bangin Israel-te a gamta uhi; amate in leitang a hawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gilgal-a Joshua kungah Judah mite a pei uhi; tuale Keniz-te Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb in a kungah, “ Topa in nang le kei tawh kisai-in Kadesh-barnea-ah Pasien’ mi Moses tunga a thugente na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A gam vandap dingin Topa’ nasem Moses in Kadesh-barnea panin ei sawl lai-in kum sawmli ka pha hi; tuale keima in ama tungah a man bangin thu ka puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei tawh a peito ka guolte in mite a lungkiesah uhi; hizongle keima in lungsim tahpi tawh Topa ka Pasien ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni-in Moses a kiciem a, ‘ Topa ka Pasien na lungsim tahpi tawh zui na hi ziehin na keng tawh na totsa leitangte nangma le na tate adingin gouluo ahi zing ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in na mu bangin ama in a cisa ma bangin gamlahah Israel-te a pei sung, Topa in Moses tungah tam thu a gen huna kipanin kum sawmli le kum nga sung, Topa in ei nungtasah hi; tuale tuni-in kei kum sawmgiet le kumnga ka pha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses in ei sawl lai ma bangin tuni-in ka tha a hat lai hi; ka thatang zong gal do nading le vaikuon vaitun nadingin khum hun lai-a ka thatang ma bang lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in khum ni-a Topa in a gensa tam muoltung gam kei ei pie in; azieh pen kul tawh ki-im khuopite tawh Anak-te khum sungah bangci om ci na zahsa uh ahi hi; Topa in ei ompi ding a, Topa’ ci bangin amate ka notmang zo kha ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in ama thupha pie a, Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb tungah gouluo dingin Hebron a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in lungsim tahpi tawh Israel-te’ Topa Pasien a zui ziehin tuni dongin Hebron pen Keniz mi Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb’ gouluo a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-a tam Hebron’ min pen nidang lai-in Kiriath-arba kici hi; tam Arba pen Anak-te lahah mi lienpen khat ahi hi. Tuale khum gamah gal kidona a veng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Judah mite’ nga pen leitaw lam Edom gamgi dong tung a, leitaw lam a gamla pen mun Zin gam dong bansuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitaw lam amau’ gamgi pen Si Tuipi tawpna dong, leitaw lam kinga tuidawh panin kipan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />leitaw lam Akrabbim katona pan peisuohin Zin dong ban a, Kadesh-barnea leitaw lama Hezron dung zui-in Addan cieng dong peito a, Karka lamah kihei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azmon dungah peisuoh a, Egypt Lui-ah pusuohin tuipi-ah a tawp hi. Tam pen na leitaw lam gamgi ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale nisuona lam gamgi pen Si Tuipi ahi a, Jordan gun tunna dong ahi hi. Leilu lampang gamgi pen Jordan gun tunna tuipi dawh panin kipan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuale Beth-hoglah lamah gamgi peito-in, Beth-arabah leilu lamah peisuoh a, Reuben tapa Bohan’ Suongtumpi dongin tua gamgi peito a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akor Kuom panin Debir dong gamgi peito a, leilu lam manaw-in Adummin katona tawh kimaingat-a om Gilgal lamah kihei hi; En-shemesh lui dungah gamgi pei-in En-rogel ah tawp hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua ciengin Jebus-te’ (Jerusalem a cina); leitaw lam kumsuhna a om Hinnom’ tapa kuomah gamgi peito a, Rephaim kuom leilu lam mong, nitumna lam Hinnom kuom galkhatah a kihlung muol dawnah gamgi kato hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ciengin muolvum panin Nephtoah tuite’ tuinah dongah kihlung a, tua panin Ephron Muol khuopite-ah kihlung phei hi. Tua ciengin Baalah (Kiriath-jearim a cina) lamah gamgi kuol pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Baalah nitumna lam Seir Muolah gamgi kiviel a, tua panin peisuohin Jearim Muol (Chesalon a cina) leilu lam muolken ah peisuohin Beth-shemesh-ah peisuh a, Timnah gei-ah peisuoh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ekron leilu lam muolken ah gamgi pei a, Shikkeron ah kivielin, tuale Baalah muol zui-in Jabneel-ah pusuoh hi; tua ciengin tuipi-ah tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitumna lam gamgi pen tuipi lien Mediterranean le a dung teng ahi hi. Tam pen amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Judah mite kimvela gamgi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Joshua a thupiehna tawh kizui-in ama in Judah mite lahah Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb tungah tanh khat ahi Kiriath-arba, Hebron a cina, (Arba pen Anak’ pa hi) a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Caleb in khum panin Anak’ tapa thumte Sheshai, Ahiman le Talmai, Anak’ suonlehlahte a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum panin Debir-a tengte sim dingin ama kuon to hi; tu-a Debir a min pen nidangin Kiriath-sepher kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Caleb in, “Kiriath-sepher sim-a, a la zo pa tungah a zi dingin ka tanu Achsah ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Caleb’ sanggampa Kenaz’ tapa Othniel in la zo hi. Tuale ama in a zi dingin a tanu Achsah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kungah tua nu a tun ciengin a pa kungah logam khat ngen dingin a pausawl hi. A laa tung panin a kum ciengin Caleb in tua nu kungah, “Bang dei na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua nu in ama kungah, “Letsong khat ei pie in. Negeb gamah nei koi tah ngalin cia tuikhuhte zong ei pie in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Caleb in ciatui tungta le ciatui neitate ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Judah minamte’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lei tawlam gam mong Edom gamgi lamah Judah minamte’ nei khuopi te: Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kinah, Dimonah, Adadah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kedesh, Hazor, Ithnan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziph, Telem, Bealoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazor-hadattah, Kerioth-hezron (Hazor a kici)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amam, Shema, Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-gaddah, Heshmon, Beth-pelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Beer-sheba, Biziothiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Baalah, Iim, Ezem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltolad, Chesil, Hormah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziklag, Madmannah, Sansannah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain, le Rimmon: a unpi-in khuopi sawmni le kuo, a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuale lei ngiemna lamah Eshtaol, Zorah, Ashnah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanoah, En-gannim, Tappuah, Enam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jarmuth, Adullam, Socoh, Azekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Shaaraim, Adithaim, Gederah, Gederothaim: khuopi sawm le li le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zenan, Hadashah, Migdal-gad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dilan, Mizpah, Jokthe-el,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lachish, Bozkath, Eglon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cabbon, Lahmam, Chitlish,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gederoth, Beth-dagon, Naamah, le Makkedah: khuopi sawm le guh le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Libnah, Ether, Ashan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Iphtah, Ashnah, Nezib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keilah, Achzib, le Mareshah: khuopi kuo le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ekron, a khut nei-a teng le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ekron panin tuipi dong, Ashdod lam nai-a om zosie, a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ashdod, a khuopite le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi; Gaza, a khuopite le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi; Egypt Lui dong le Tuipi Lien gei cieng dong tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuale muoltung gamah, Shamir, Jattir, Socoh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Dannah, Kiriath-sannah (Debir a kici),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Anab, Eshtemoh, Anim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Goshen, Holon, le Giloh: khuopi sawm le khat, a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Arab, Dumah, Eshan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Janim, Beth-tappuah, Aphekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Humtah, Kiriath-arba (Hebron a kici), le Zior: khuopi kuo le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Maon, Carmel, Ziph, Juttah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kain, Gibeah, le Timnah: khuopi sawm le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Halhul, Beth-zur, Gedor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Maarath, Beth-anoth, le Eltekon: khuopi guh le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Kiriath-baal (Kiriath-jearim a kici) leh Rabbah: khuopi ni le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Senel gamah Beth-arabah, Middin, Secacah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nibshan, Ci Khuopi, le En-gedi: khuopi guh le a khuoneute utawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ahi vangin Judah mite in Jerusalem-a teng Jebus-te a notkhie zo sih uhi, tuaci’n tuni dongin Jebus-te pen Judah mite tawh Jerusalem-ah a tengton uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph-te’ tanh pen Jericho luite’ nisuona lam Jericho gei Jordan panin senel gamah pei a, Jericho panin muoltung gamte tawnin Bethel dong peito hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua ciengin Bethel panin Luz-ah pei-in Archi-te’ gam Ataroth lam kantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin nitumna lam Japhlet-te’ gam lamah peisuh a, Beth-horon Neinung gam cieng dongah peisuh hi. Tua ciengin Gezer-ah pei-in tuipi-ah tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joseph-te’-Manasseh le Ephraim-in amau’ gouluo a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau’ innkuon zui-in Ephraim-te’ gam pen a nei-a bang ahi hi: Amau’ gamgi pen nisuona lamah Ataroth-addar hi a, Beth-horon Tungnung dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale a gamgi pen khum panin tuipi cieng dongah pei hi; leilu lamah Michmethath a om hi; tua ciengin Taanath-shiloh lamah nisuona lamah gamgi kuol pei a, nisuona lam Janoah dong peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Janoah panin Ataroth le Naarah ah peisuh a, Jericho nawhin Jordan-ah tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah panin nitumna lam Kanah Lui-ah gamgi pei-in tuipi-ah tawp hi. Tam teng khu amau’ innkuon kuonin Ephraim minamte’ gouluo ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasseh-te’ gouluo sung panin Ephraim-te adinga a kikhenkhie khuopite, le a khuoneu zosiete tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle amate in Gezer sunga teng Canaan-te a notmang sih vua, tuaci’n tuni dongin Canaan-te, Ephraim-te lahah a teng vua, ahi vangin thona-aana nasep kisemsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama pen Joseph’ tacil ahi ziehin Manasseh minam tungah tanh kipie hi. Manasseh’ tapa Gilead’ pa Machir tungah Gilead le Bashan gam kipie hi. A ziehpen ama galhang mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Manasseh minam a omlaite Abiezer, Helek, Asriel, Shechem, Hepher, le Shemida-te tungah amau’ innkuon zui-in tanh kipie hi; tam teng pen a innkuon zui-a Joseph tapa Manasseh’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in Manasseh’ tapa, Machir’ tapa Gilead’ tapa Hepher’ tapa Zelophehad in tapa nei lo a, tanu beh nei hi; tuale a tanute’ min in: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, le Tirzah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempu Eleazar le Nun’ tapa Joshua le makaite mai-ah a pei vua, “Ka sanggam pasalte tawh gouluo ei piehton nadingin Topa in Moses thu a pie hi,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n Topa’ thupiehna bangin ama in a pate uh’ sanggamte lahah amate gou a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Jordan galkhata om Gilead le Bashan banah Manasseh tungah tanh sawm kie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Manasseh’ tanute in a tapate tawh gou a nga ton uhi. A omlai Manasseh-te tungah Gilead leitang kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manasseh gam in Asher panin Shechem nisuona lama om Michmethath dong ban hi; tua ciengin leitaw lamah En-tappuah-te’ gamgi peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah leitang pen Manasseh-a’ ahi a, ahi vangin Manasseh’ gamgi-a om Tappuah khuo pen Ephraim tapate-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kanah Lui-ah gamgi a peisuh hi. Manasseh’ khuopite lahah leitaw lama om tam sunga khuopite, Ephraim-a’ ahi hi. Tua ciengin lui leilu lampangah Manasseh’ gamgi peito-in tuipi-ah tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leitaw lam gam pen Ephraim-a’ hi a, leilu lam teng Manasseh-a’ hi-in, tuipi pen a gamgi ahi hi; leilu lamah Asher gam banin nisuona lamah Issachar dong ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Issachar le Asher gam sungah Manasseh in Beth-shean le a khuoneute, Ibleam le a khuoneute, Dor-a tengte le a khuoneute, Endor-a tengte le a khuoneute, Taanach-a tengte le a khuoneute, le Megiddon-a tengte le a khuoneute tang lai hi. (a thumna pen Naphath ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle Manasseh-te in tam khuopite a luo zo sih uhi. Ahi vangin khum gamah Canaan-te a teng suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel-te a thahat ciengun amate in Canaan-te thona-aana nasep semsahin a notmang sieng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joseph’ minam in Joshua hopi a, “Bang dingin gouluo dingn kote tanh khat le se khat beh ei pie na hei? Topa in kote thupha ei pie-in tampi ka pha ta uhi?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joshua in a kung vuah, “No mi tampi pha-in no dingin Ephraim muoltung gam teng a neu seng leh gamlahah peito unlen noma dingin Periz-te’ gam le Rephaim-te’ gammang lahah gam sat un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph’ minam in, “Ko adingin muoltung gam kicing zo lo hi; hinanle zanglei-a teng Canaan-te zosie, Beth-shean le a khuoneute le Jezreel kuom sunga tengte in sia sakol leengte nei uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in Joseph’ innkuon Ephraim-te le Manasseh-te kungah, “Note mi tampi na hi tahtah ta vua, zong na thahat mama uhi; note in tanh khat beh na nga sih ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />muoltung gam noma-a’ hi ding a, gammang tulah hinanle vat ngilin a gamla pen gamgi tawp dongin na luo ding uhi; azieh pen Canaan-te in sia sakol leengte nei-in thahat mama nan ule amate na notmang zo ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shiloh-ah Israel mihon buppi a kikhawm vua, khum munah kikhopna puonbuh a lam uhi. A mai vuah khum gam zawsa-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te lahah gouluo kipie nai lo minam sagi omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in Israel-te kungah,” Topa , na pu na pate uh Pasien in no ang piehsa leitangah pei-in tua gam na luo ding uh bang tanvei ziekai lai ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minam khat panin mi thum ta ei pie unlen, amate tua gamah vah kawikawi-in amau’ luo dinga ngaisutna tawh a leitang omzie lai tawh a ciemte dingin amate ka sawl ding hi. Tua ciengin ka kungah ang peikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua leitang pen se sagi-in a khen ding vua, Judah pen leitaw lam ama’ gam ma-ah om suohin Joseph’ innkuonte leilu lam ama gam ma-ah om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua leitang khen sagi-in na khen ding vua, tam sunga ka kungah na ciemtena uh nang peipi ding uhi; keima in tam mun Topa i Pasien mai-ah note dingin ai ka san ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi-te in note lahah tanh a nei sih uhi, bang ding ahei cile Topa’ siempu nasep khu a gouluo uh ahi hi; tuale Gad, Reuben, le Manasseh minam alangte in Topa’ nasem Moses in amate a piehsa Jordan nisuona lam galkhatah amau’ gouluo a nga zo ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite kuonkhie uhi; tuale Joshua in leitang ciemtena giel dinga pei mite thu pie a, “Gam sungah vah kawikawi-in leitang ciemtena hing giel unlen, ka kungah hing peikia un; tuale Shiloh muna Topa mai tami munah note dingin ai ka san ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite kuonin gam sungah a suhva a tova vua, laibu khat sungah tua gam a khuokhuo-in khen sagi-in a khen uhi; tua ciengin Shiloh giephuola Joshua kungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua in Topa mai Shiloh-ah amate dingin ai a san hi; tuale khum munah Joshua in Israel-te khat ciet tungah a tanh ciet uh a hawmpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin minam sunga a innkuonte utawh kizui-in aisanna tung a, amate kipie gam pen Judah minam le Joseph minamte kikalah kie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leilu lam panga amau’ gamgi pen Jordan panin kipan hi; tua ciengin leilu lamah Jericho leilu lam muolken banto a, tua ciengin muoltung gam nawhin nitumna lamah pei hi; tuale Beth-aven sehnel gamah tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum panin gamgi in leitaw lamah Luz lam manaw a, Luz (Bethel a kici) muolken dongah peisuh a, khum panin Beth-horon Neinung leitaw lama om muoltunga Ataroth-adder khuo-ah tungsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin gamgi in mundang zuonin nitumna lamah kihei-in pei a, Beth-horon galkhat leitaw lama om muol panin nitumna lampang leitaw lamah kihei a, Judah minamte-a’ ahi Kiriath-baal (Kiriath-jearim kici) ah tawp hi. Tami in a nitumna lam pang a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim khuopi gei-ah leitaw lam gamgi kipan hi; tua panin Ephron ah gamgi pei a, Nephtoah Tuite nah cieng dong tung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua ciengin Rephaim kuom leilu lam monga om Hinnom tapa’ kuom kigalmuna gamgi muol ah gamgi a pei hi; tua ciengin Jebus-te’ muolken leitaw lam Hinnom kuomah peisuhin En-rogel ah a tungsuh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tua ciengin leilu lam manaw-in kawi a, En-shemesh ah peisuohin, khum panin Adummim katona galkhat, Geliloth ah a pei hi; tua ciengin Reuben’ tapa Bohan’ Suongpi-ah a peisuh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuale Beth-arabah muolken leilu lamah gamgi peisuohin Arabah-ah peisuh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua ciengin Beth-hoglah muolken leilu lam dong gamgi kihlung hi; Jordan mong leitaw lam, Si Tuipi dawh leilu lamah Jordan lui tawpna leitaw lamah gamgi a tawp hi; tam pen leitaw lam gamgi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jordan gun in nisuona lamah gamgi a piengsah hi. Tam khu a innkuon zui-in a kimvel vuah a gamgi a gamgi-a Benjamin minamte’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in amau’ innkuon zui-a Benjamin minamte’ khuopite Jericho, Beth-hoglah, Emek-keziz,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beth-arabah, Zemaraim, Bethel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Avvim, Parah, Ophrah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chephar-ammoni, Ophni, Geba - khuopi sawm le ni le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon, Ramah, Beeroth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpah, Chephirah, Mozah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Rekem, Irpeel, Taralah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zela, Haeleph, Jebus (Jerusalem a cina), Gibeah le Kiriath-jearim, khuopi sawm le li le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi. Tam pen a innkuon utawh kizui-in Benjamin minamte’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Simeon minam dingin aisan a niveina tung hi; amau’ gouluo in Judah minamte’ gouluo gam sung huom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A gouluote uh pen Beer-sheba, Sheba, Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Balah, Ezem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltolad, Bethul, Hormah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziklag, Beth-marcaboth, Hazar-susah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-lebaoth, le Sharuhen khuopi- sawm le thum le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ain, Rimmon, Ether, le Ashan - khuopi li le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Negeb gam Ramah-a om Baalath-beer cieng dong le a kima om khuoneute zosie tawh ahi hi. Tam pen a innkuon zui-a Simeon minamte’ gouluo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simeon minam’ gouluo in Judah minamte’ gam sung kimkhat a huom hi; azieh pen Judah minamte’ tanh pen amate dingin gol luo a, tua ziehin Simeon minam in amau’ gouluo sung panin gouluo a ngasawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Zebulun minam dingin aisan a thumveina tung hi. Amau’ gouluo gamgi in Sarid cieng dong ban hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua ciengin nitumna lamah a gamgi peito-in, Maralah ah peisuoh a, Dabbesheth va su ta a, tua ciengin Jokneam nisuona lama om lui ban hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sarid panin nisuona lamah kilehei a, nisuona lam zuonin Chisloth-tabor gamgi dong tung hi; khum panin Daberath-ah pei-in Japhia cieng banto hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khum panin nisuona lama suolam nawtin Gath-hepher, Eth-kazin suolam nisuona lam nawtin Rimmon ah peisuohin Neah lamah kawi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua ciengin leilu lama gamgi Hanathon lamah kihei a, Iphtah-el kuomah tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kattath, Nahalal, Shimron, Idalah, le Bethlehem-khuopi sawm le ni le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam pen a innkuon tawh kizui-in Zebulun minamte’ gouluo hi a, tam pen amau’ khuopite le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A innkuon utawh kizui-in Issachar minamte dingin aisan a liveina tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A gam in Jezreel, Chesulloth, Shunem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hapharaim, Shion, Anaharath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rabbith, Kishion, Ebez,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Remeth, En-gannim, En-haddah, le Beth-pazzez teng huom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gamgi in Tabor, Shahazumah, le Beth-shemesh zong ban a, Jordan lui-ah a gamgi tawp hi; a khuopi uh sawm le guh le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ innkuon zui-in Issachar minamte’ gouluo ahi a, a khuopite ule a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Asher minam dingin aisan a ngaveina tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau’ gamgi huomte pen Helkath, Hali, Beten, Achshaph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Allammelech, Amad, le Mishal-te kihal hi; tua in Nitumna lamah Carmel le Shihor-libnath ban a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua ciengin nisuona lamah kihei-in Beth-dagon ah pei a, leilu lam Beth-emek le Neiel lamah Zebulun le Iphtahel kuom dong ban hi; tua ciengin leilu lam Cabul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebron, Rehob, Hammon, Kanah, le a Lien Sidon cieng dongah peito lai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tua ciengin Ramah ah gamgi kihei a, kul tawh ki-im Tyre khuopi dong tung hi; tua ciengin Hosah ah gamgi kihei a, tuipi ah tawp hi. Mahalab, Achzib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ummah, Aphek, le Rehob - khuopite huom a -khuopi sawmni le ni le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam pen a innkuon zui-a Asher minamte’ gouluo ahi a, tam khuopite a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Naphtali minam dingin aisan a guhveina tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A gamgi pen Heleph, Zaanannim-a om gangpi sing pan, le Adami-nekeb, le Jabneel panin Lakkum cieng dong pei hi; tuale Jordan ah a tawp hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tua ciengin nitumna lam Aznoth-tabor ah gamgi kihei a, khum panin Hukkok ah pei-in leitaw lamah Zebulun sukha a, nitumna lamah Asher, nisuona lamah Jordan-a Judah ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kulpi tawh a ki-im khuopite pen Ziddim, Zer, Hamath, Rakkath, Chinnereth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adamah, Ramah, Hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedesh, Edrei, En-hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Iron, Migdal-el, Horem, Beth-anath, le Beth-shemesh - khuopi sawm le kuo le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tam pen a innkuon tawh kizui-in Naphtali minamte’ gouluo ahi a, a khuopite le a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amahaw’innkuon tawh kizui-in Dan minamte dingin aisan a sagiveina tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama’ gouluo gam in Zorah, Eshtaol, Ir-shemesh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Shaalabin, Aijalon, Ithlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Elon, Timnah, Ekron,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Eltekeh, Gibbethon, Baalath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehud, Bene-berak, Gath-rimmon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Joppa galkhata om Me-jarkon le Rakkon-a gamte tawh huom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Dan-te in a gam uh a tan bepun Dan-te kuonto-in Leshem a sim vua, amate manin namsau tawh a thazaw ciengun tua gam luo-in a sungah a teng vua, a pupi uh Dan’ min la-in Leshem pen Dan a phuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tam khu amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Dan minamte’ gouluo ahi a, tam khuopite, a khuoneute tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Amate in leitang tampitah gou-in a hawm sieng zaw ciengun Israel-te in Nun’ tapa Joshua zong amate lahah gouluo a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa’ thupieh bangin amate in ama’ nget khuopi, Ephraim muoltung gama om Timnath-serah pen ama a pie uhi. Ama in tua khuopi lamkia-in a sungah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tam teng siempu Eleazar le Nun’ tapa Joshua le Israel minam innkuon lutangte in kikhopna buh lutna, Topa mai Shiloh ah aisanna tawh a hawm uh gouluote ahi hi. Tuaci’n amate in leitang hawmna a man uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Joshua hopi-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel-te kungah, ‘Moses tungtawnin na kunga kang gen bangin kibuhna khuopite se in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n sawm lopi-in ahi a, thei lona ziehin ahi zongin mi khatpo a that khapa a tai thei nading ahi hi; tua teng pen note dingin sisan phulapa kung panin kibuhna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam khuopite khatpo-ah mithatpa tai-in khuopi tunkot lutna-ah ding ding a, tua khuopi upate kungah a thu gen ding hi; tua ciengin khuopi sungah a taipa kipeipi-in om nading mun khat kipie ding a, amate tawh omton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Phulapa in ama a nuadel leh amate in tuapa tungah mithatpa a pie sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile a vengpa pen theikhielna tawh kithat kha ahi bo a, a tawpsa hun sungin a vengpa tawh kigalneina bangma om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thukhenna thuoh dingin mihon mai-ah ama a din masangsie, le tua hun laitaha siempu lien pa a si masangsie-in, tua khuopi sungah ama om den ding hi: Tua zaw ciengin mi thatpa pen a khutkhielna khuo sunga a inn ah peikia thei ding hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Naphtali muoltung gam sunga om Galilee gam sung panin Kadesh, Ephraim muoltung gam sungah Shechem, le Judah muoltung gam sungah Kiriath-arba (Hebron a kici) khuote a tuomkoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale amate in Jericho nisuona Jordan galkhatah Reuben minam sung panin muoltung zang sehnel gama om Bezer khuo, Gad minam sung panin Gilead gam sunga om Ramoth khuo, le Manasseh minam sung panin Bashan gam sunga om Golan khuote a se uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam teng pen Israel-te zosie le amate lahah a peem khuolmite adingin sawm lopi-a mi khatpo a that khapa in mihonpi mai-ah a din masang, phulapa khutlum tawh si loin a tai thei nadinga kise khuopite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu Eleazar, Nun tapa Joshua, le Israel minam innkuon lutangte kungah Levi innkuon lutangte a va pei vua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Canaan gam Shiloh muna om amate kungah, “Ka ten nading uh khuopite le ka ganhonte vua dingin Moses tungtawnin a lonona gamte tawh ko ei kipieh ding Topa in thu pie zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel-te in Topa’ thupiehsa bangin amau’ gouluo gamte sung panin Levi-te tungah a nei-a khuopite le lonona gamte a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kohath innkuonte dingin aisan tung hi. Tuaci’n siempu Aaron’ suonlehlah ahi Levi-te in Judah, Simeon, le Benjamin minamte tung panin aisanna tawh khuopi sawm le thum nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A omlai Kohath-te in Ephraim minam, Dan minam, le Manasseh minam alangte tung panin aisanna tawh khuopi sawm nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gershon-te in Issachar minam, Asher minam, Naphtali minam, le Bashan gam sunga om Manasseh minam alangte tung panin aisanna tawh khuopi sawm le thum nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Merari-te in amau’ innkuon tawh kizui-in Reuben minam, Gad minam, le Zebulun minamte tung panin khuopi sawm le ni nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungtawnin a thupiehsa bangin Israel-te in Levi-te tungah aisanna tawh tam khuopite le a lonona gamte a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah minam le Simeon minam sung panin a min kigiel tua khuopite a pie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate tungah aisanna a tuh masah ziehin Levi-te ahi Kohath innkuon sung panin Aaron’ suonlehlahte tungah tuate tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in Judah muoltung gama Hebron a kici Kiriath-arba, (Arba pen Anak’ pa ahi hi) le a kimvela lonona gamte tawh a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua khuopi’ lote le a khuoneute pen Jephunneh’ tapa Caleb tungah a nei dingin kipie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in siempu Aaron’ suonle hlahte tungah mi thatte dinga kibuhna khuopi Hebron a lonona gamte tawh, Libnah a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jattir a lonona gamte tawh, Eshtemoa a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Holon a lonona gamte tawh, Debir a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ain a lonona gamte tawh, Juttah a lonona gamte tawh, Beth-shemesh a lonona gamte tawh, tam minam nite sung panin khuopi kuo a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin minam sung panin Gibeon a lonona gamte tawh, Geba a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anathoth a lonona gamte tawh, Almon a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi li a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron suonlehlahte’ khuopite, a siempute a unpi-in khuopi sawm le thum le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levi-te innkuon sung panin Kohath be ahi a omlai Kohath-te tungah a kipie khuopite pen Ephraim minamte-a’ sung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ephraim muoltung gama om khuopite sung panin mi thatte adingin Shechem a lonona gamte tawh, Gezer a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kibzaim a lonona gamte tawh, Bethhoron a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi li amate kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan minam sung panin: Elteke a lonona gamte tawh, Gibbethon a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aijalon a lonona gamte tawh, Gath-rimmon a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi li kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Manasseh minam alangte sung panin: Taanach a lonona gamte tawh, Gath-rimmon a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi ni kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohath innkuon a omlai mite gouluo nga khuopite a unpi-in a lonona gamte tawh khuopi sawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Levi innkuon sunga om Gershon-te tungah mi thatte kibuhna khuopi dingin Manasseh minam alangte gouluo nga sung panin Bashan gam sunga om Golan khuopi le a lonona gamte tawh, Beeshterah khuopi a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi ni kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Issachar minam sung panin: Kishion-a lonona gamte tawh, Daberath a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jarmuth a lonona gamte tawh, En-gannim a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi li kipie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asher minamte sung panin Mishal a lonona gamte tawh, Abdon a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Helkath a lonona gamte tawh, le Rehob a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi li kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Naphtali minamte sung panin: mi thatte kibuhna khuopi dingin Galilee gam sunga om Kedesh a lonona gamte tawh, Hammoth-dor a lonona gamte tawh, Kartan a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi thum kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gershon-te’ innkuon tuomtuomte’ khuopite a unpi-in sawm le thum le a lonona gamte tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Levi mi a omlai Merari innkuonte tungah, Zebulun minam sung panin: Jokneam a lonona gamte tawh, Kartan a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimnah a lonona gamte tawh, Nahalal a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi li kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Reuben minam sung panin: Bezer a lonona gamte tawh, Jahaz a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedemoth a lonona gamte tawh, Mephaath a lonona gamte tawh, khuopi li kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gad minam sung panin: mi thatte adingin kibuhna khuopi Ramoth le a lonona gamte tawh, Mahanaim a lonona gamte tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Heshbon a lonona gamte tawh, Jezar a lonona gamte tawh, a unpi-in khuopi li kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Levi innkuon a omlai ahi Merari innkuon tuomtuomte ading khuopi kipiete a unpi-in sawm le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel-te’ gouluo lahah Levi-te’ khuopi a unpi-in a lonona gamte tawh sawm li le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tam khuopite in a kimvel vuah lonona gam a nei ciet uhi; tami khuopi zosie zong tua bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tam bangin Topa in amau’ pu le pate tungah pieh dinga a na ciemsa leitang zosie Israel tungah pie a, amate in tua gam luo-in tua munah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuale a pu a pate tungah a ciemsa bangin sil bangkimah Topa in amate a lungmuongsah hi; Topa in amau’ khut sungah a gal zosie uh a pieh ziehin a galte uh khat beh in amate nang zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te tunga a ciemsa thuhoi zosie khat beh a pelem om lo hi; a unpi-in tangtung kim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in Reuben-te, Gad-te le Manasseh minam alangte hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a kung vuah, “ Topa’ nasem Moses in ang thupieh zosie a unpi-in na zui sieng zo ta vua, kang thupiehna zosie-ah ka thu na mang zo ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tam ni tampi sung tuni dongin na unaute na taisan sih vua, Topa na Pasien uh’ ang sawlna limtahin na zui zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale tu-in ama in a ciemsa bangin Topa na Pasien un amate tawlngahna a pie hi; tua ahi ziehin Topa’ nasem Moses in ang piehsa Jordan galkhat, na tan ding uh gama om na puonbuh lam vuah kihei-in pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ nasem Moses in ang pieh thupiehna le thuhilna ahi, Topa na Pasien uh it ding, a lampi zosie zui ding, a thupiehnate zui ding, ama bel ding le na lungsim zosie ule na hinna zosie utawh ama’ na nasep ding uh limtahin ngaisun un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joshua in amate thupha pie-in peisah a, tuale amate a innlam vuah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in Manasseh minam alangte tungah Moses in Jordan nisuona lam Bashan gam sungah amau’ tan ding gam pie zo hi; hinanle Joshua in adang alangte tungah Jordan nitumna a unaute uh Israel-te tungah neisa a pie hi. Joshua in a puonbuh vuah amate sawldawhin thupha a pieh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama in a kung vuah, “Hauna lienpi, ganhon tampi le ngun, kham, sumngo, sia le puon tampi tawh na puonbuh vuah peikia un; na galte uh’ van na tomte uh na unaute tawh hawm un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte, Moses tungtawnin Topa’ thupieh banga a nga uh amau’ leitang ahi Gilead gam zuon dingin Canaan gam sunga om Shiloh munah Israel-te tawh kikhenin inn ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Canaan gam sung Jordan gei-a om gam ah a tun ciengun Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte in Jordan gei-a tua munah maitam gol mama khat a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel-te in Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte in Jordan gei-a om gam sung, Canaan gamgi dung, Israel-te’ gam lampangah maitam khat a lam uh a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te in tua thu a zah ciengun amate a do dingin Shiloh munah Israel mihon buppi a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel-te in Gilead gama Reuben-te, Gad-te le Manasseh minam alangte kungah siempu Eleazar tapa Phinehas,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />le ama tawh uhpi mi sawm, Israel minam innkuon panin khat ciet, Israel innkuonte lahah innkuon lutang ahite vive sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gilead gam sunga om Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh minam alangte kungah amate pei-in a kung vuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Topa’ mihon buppi in, ‘ Topa ledona-ah tuni-in noma dingin maitam khat lamna tawh Topa zuina panin kihei-in Israel Pasien tungah na gamtatna sa uh ahi tam na letatna ukhu bang bep ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa’ mihon buppi tungah khum zieha gimna khat ang tunna, ei le ei i kisiensuo nai lona uh ahi Peor-a i mawna uh kicing sa nai vaset loin, tuni-in Topa zuina panin kiheikia ding na hi uh amah? Tuni-in Topa na ledo uleh zing ciengin Israel mi vannuoi tungah ama ang lungthah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in na leitang uh a sieng lo ahile Topa’ biehbuh kitunna mun Topa’ leitangah hing pei unlen kote lahah luo hing nei un; Topa ledo beh sih unlen, ahi sihle Topa i Pasien’ maitam ahi lo noma dinga maitam khat lamna tawh kote ei ledo sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ki-ap vante tungah Zerah’ tapa Achan a muonhuoi lo ziehin Israel mihonpi zosie tungah lungthahna tung hi lo amah? Ama’ mawna ziehin ama beh si lo hi!’ ci uhi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Reuben-te, Gad-te le Manasseh minam alangte in Israel innkuon lutangte dawngin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“ Topa , pasien-te’ Pasien!, Topa , pasien-te’ Pasien! Ama in thei hi; Israel-te in zong thei ta uheh! Tam khu ledona ahi a, Topa upna pana ka peikhiel nading ule, Topa zuina pana ka piel nading vua maitam lam ka hi uleh tuni-in kote ei hinkhawi da heh; tua ahi sihle zong tua tungah meihal biehna ahi a, an tawh biehna ahi a, thunuam biehna ahi zongin pieh nadinga a lam ka hi uleh Topa mama in ei thuh taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua bang ahi sih hi! Ang tung ding hunte-ah na tate un ka tate uh kungah, ‘Israel Pasien Topa tawh no bang kisai na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile no Reuben-te le Gad-te, le ko kikalah Topa in gamgi dingin Jordan bawl zo hi; Topa sungah tanh na nei sih uhi,’ a ci khah ding uh zauna tawh ka bawl uh ahi bo hi. Tuaci’n ka tate un Topa a bieh ding uh na tate un khahtan kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin, ‘Meihal biehna ahi a, biehpiehna ding ahi zongin hi loin, ama opna ah ka meihal biehnate uh, ka biehpiehnate ule thunuam-a ka biehnate utawh Topa’ na kasep na uh ko le no kikal le ei haw zaw cienga i suonlehlahte kikalah teci dingin maitam khat bawl vai. Tua bang hi sih mawh leh ang tung ding hunte-ah na tate un ka tate uh kungah, “ Topa sungah tanh na nei sih uhi,” ci thei kha ding uhi,’ ka ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ziehin ang tung ding hunte-ah ko tung ahi a, ka suonlehlahte uh tungah ahi zongin tam bangin ang kici leh, ‘Meihal biehna ding ahi a, biehpiehna ding ahi zongin hi loin, no le ko kikalah teci dinga ka pu ka pate un a bawl Topa’ maitam lim en un,’ i ci ding uhi, ci-in ka ngaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama biehbuh mai-a om Topa ka Pasien uh’ maitam simlo meihal biehna ahi a, an tawh biehna ahi a, biehpiehna ding ahi zongin maitam khat lamna tawh Topa ledo-in Topa zuina pana a piel ka hi vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siempu Phinehas le ama tawh a om mihon uhpi, Israel innkuon lutangte in Reuben-te, Gad-te, le Manasseh-te thugen a zah ciengun a lungkim mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siempu Eleazar’ tapa Phinehas in Reuben-te, Gad-te le Manasseh-te kungah, “ Topa dona sil sie na bawl lo ziehun eite lahah Topa om hi, ci-in tuni-in i thei hi. Tu-in note in Topa in gim a pieh nading panin Israel-te na hunkhie uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gilead gama om Reuben-te le Gad-te kung panin Israel-te opna Canaan gamah Eleazar’ tapa siempu Phinehas le uhpite kilekia-in amate kungah thu a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua a thupuoh un Israel-te lungdamsah hi; tuale Israel-te in Pasien phatin Reuben-te le Gad-te’ tenna leitang susie-in amate gala a sim ding uh thu a gen nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Reuben-te le Gad-te in tua maitam “Teci” ci-in phuo uhi; “Azieh pen Topa in Pasien a hina thu i kikal vuah teci khat ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Israel’ kimvela om a galte zosie panun tawlngahna a pieh zaw a sawtpi ciengin Joshua zong vuoi-in kum tampi pha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua in Israel zosie, upate le makaite, thukhente le uliente hlanin a kung vuah, “Tu-in kei vuoi-in kum tampi ka pha ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale note ziehin Topa na Pasien un tam minam zosie tungah a sepsa zosie na mu zo ta uhi. Bang ding ahei cile note dinga gal ang dopieh pa khu Topa na Pasien uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A omlai minamte ahile Jordan panin Tuipi Lien nitumna lam donga keima in ka suhmangthaisa minamte zosie tawh, na minamte uh’ gouluo dingin na tung vuah kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na mai vuah amate nua sawnin na muna panun a notmang ding hi; tuale Topa na Pasien un na tung vua ang ciem bangin amau’ gam na luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Moses’ thukham laibu sunga kigielte zosie limtahin zui-in semin, ziet le vei-ah piel sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaci’n tam sunga na lah vua a omlai tam minamte tawh kicisaw loin, a pasiente uh’ min lo loin, tuate tawh zong kiciem loin, amau’ na zong sem loin, amau’ mai-ah zong kun sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuni donga na gamtat bangun Topa na Pasien uh pom lenlon zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in na mai vuah a lien le a thahat minamte a delmang zo ta hi; note ahile tuni dongin koima khat beh in ang nang zo nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na tung vua ang ciemsa bangin note dinga ang dopieh pa khu Topa na Pasien uh ahi ziehin note mi khat in mi tulkhat na taimangsah zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa na Pasien uh na it ding uh hoitahin ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note nuakia-in tam sunga na lah vua om a hing sun teng tawh kipawlin amate tawh kitengin, note in a numeite tenpi-in amate in zong na numeite a tenpi uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na mai vuah tam minamte a notmang nawn sih ding hi, ci-in teltahin thei ta un; ahi vangin Topa na Pasien un ang pieh tam gam hoi panin na manthai masangun amate no adingin piel le thang ang hi ding vua, na pang uh kisatna ciengduoi le na mit sung uh ang sun ling tawh kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tu-in leitung mi zosie’ ngaina zui-in a pei ding ka hi ta a, Topa na Pasien un note tawh kisai a kamciem zosie pelem lo hi, ci na lungsim ule na hinna zosie vuah na thei uhi; a unpi-in note dingin tangtungin khat zong kipelh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin note tawh kisai-in Topa na Pasien un ang kamciem na hoi zosie note dingin ang tangtun bang lienin Topa na Pasien un ang piehsa tam leitang hoi panin note ang suhsiet masangin, Topa in na tung vuah sietna zosie ang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in ang piehsa Topa na pasien uh’ thuciemna palsatin pasien dangte kungah pei-in, a na uh semin, a mai vua na kun uleh, Topa na Pasien un note tawh kisai ang ciem sil hoi zosie a tun ma bangin, na tung vuah Topa lungthahna ang kuong ding a, note tunga ang pieh leitang hoi panin mallangin na mangthai ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in Shechem-ah Israel minam zosie a kaikhawm a, a upate, a makaite, a thukhente, le a vaihawmte hlan hi; tuale Pasien mai-ah amate ciet a kipulah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua in mite kungah, “Israel Pasien, Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Tang lai-in na pu na pate uh - Terah le a tapate Abraham le Nahor- Euphrates gun galkhatah tengin pasien dangte’ na sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin gungal panin na pu uh Abraham la-in Canaan gam muncin tengah ka peipi kawikawi a, a suonlehlahte tampi ka phasah hi. Ama tungah Isaac ka pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaac tungah Jacob le Esau ka pie hi. A nei dingin Seir muoltung gam Esau ka pie a, hizongle Egypt ah Jacob le a tate a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in Moses le Aaron sawlin a gam sunga ka sepnate tawh Egypt ka gimsah a, tua zaw ciengin note kang peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt panin na pu na pate uh ka peipi ciengin tuipi na tung uhi; tuale Egypt-te in na pu na pate uh’ leeng le sakol tung tuongte tawh San Tuipi dong del uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa tungah a kiko ciengun ama in note le Egypt-te kikalah khuomiel koi a, a tung vuah tuipi luongsahin amate a hlummang sah hi; tuale Egypt tunga ka bawl nate na mit utawh na mu uhi. tua zaw ciengin senel gamah zong hun sawtpi na teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jordan galkhata teng Amor-te’ leitangah note kang peipi hi; amate in hing do-in, na khut sung vuah amate kang pie hi, tuale a leitang uh na luo vua, keima in na mai vuah amate ka susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel do dingin Moab kumpipa Zippor’ tapa Balak a kuon hi. Ama in note ang samsie dingin Beor’ tapa Balaam cielin sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahi vangin keima in Balaam thu ka mang sih hi; tua ziehin ama in note thupha ang pie hi; tuaci’n keima in Balak khut sung panin note kang hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jordan galkhatah pei-in Jericho na tun ciengun, Jericho khuo mite in ang do uhi. Tuale Amor-te, Periz-te, Canaan-te, Hit-te, Girgash-te, Hiv-te le Jebus-te in zong note ang do vua, na khut sung vuah amate kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na masang vuah tunpi ka sawl a, tua in na mai panun Amor kumpi nite a delmang hi; tua khu na namsau ule na thaltang utawh na nawkhiet uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sep lo uh leitang, na sat lo uh khuopite kang pie a, tuate sungah na teng uhi; na suon lo uh lenggui huon pan le olive lo panin a ga na ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Topa zatah unlen, lungsim tahpi le thumanna tawh ama’ na sem un; na pu na pate un Gun gal le Egypt gam sungah a na a seppieh uh pasien-te koi dawh ta unlen, Topa’ na sem ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in Topa’ na na sep nuom sih uleh, gun galkhatah a na na seppieh uh na pu na pate uh’ pasien ahi a, na tenna uh gam sunga om Amor-te’ pasien ahi zongin, a na na seppieh ding popo uh tuni-in teel un; ahi vangin kei le ka innkuonpite in ahile Topa’ na ka sem ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin mite in a dawng vua, “Adang pasiente’ na sem dingin Topa ka taisan vawt sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />azieh pen saltanna Egypt gam panin eite le i pu i pate ei peipi-in, i muna vua tua bang lim thupite a bawl pa khu Topa i Pasien ahi hi. Ama in i peina lampi tungtawn le i nawh khah mi zosie lahah eite ei kemcing hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuale Topa in i mai vuah tua gama teng Amor-te zosie a notmang hi. Tua ahi ziehin ama i Pasien ahi ziehin eite in zong Topa’ na i sem ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanle Joshua in mite kungah, “ Topa’ na na sem thei sih ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile ama pen a siengtho Pasien ahi a, a thangsie Pasien zong ahi hi; ama in na thupalsatnate uh ahi a, na mawnate uh ahi zongin ang maisah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa taisanin gamdang pasien-te’ na na sep uleh, na tung vuah ama ang migit zaw ciengin kihei-in na tung vuah sietna bawlin ang maimangsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mite in Joshua kungah, “Hi lo hi, Topa’ na ka sem bo ding uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joshua in mite kungah, “ Topa’ na sep ding na teelna vuah no le no teci na hi uhi,” a ci hi. Tuale amate in, “Teci ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua ahile note lahah a om gamdang pasien-te paidawh unlen, Israel Pasien, Topa lamah na lungsim uh nga un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mite in Joshua kungah, “ Topa ka Pasien’ na ka sem ding vua, a thu ka mang ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-in Joshua in mite tawh Shechem ah thuciemna bawl a, amate dingin thukham le biehna ngaina kipte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joshua in Pasien’ thukham laibu sungah tam thute a giel hi. Ama in suongtum golpi khat la-in tua muna Topa’ biehinn sung gangpi sing kung nei-ah phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joshua in mi zosie kungah, “En un, tam suongtum i langkhat vuah teci ahi ding hi; azieh pen Topa in i kunga a thugen zosie tam suongtum in a za zo hi; tua ahi ziehin na Pasien uh tungah a man loin na gamtat khah uleh, tam suongtum khu na langkhat vuah teci hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n amau’ gouluona cietah Joshua in mite a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam thu teng zaw ciengin, Topa’ nasem Nun’ tapa Joshua si a, a khan kum za le kum sawm pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in a gouluo gam Gaash Muolvum leilu lam Ephraim muoltung gama om Timnath-serah ah ama a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joshua’ khang sung tungtawn le Joshua sanga si nukhia zaw upate’ khang sung tungtawnin Israel in Topa’ na sem a, tuale amate in Topa in Israel dinga a sep zosie a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel-te in Egypt pana a puoh uh Joseph’ gute, Shechem’ pa Hamor’ tapate tung panin Jacob in dangka zakhat tawh a leina Shechem khuo leikhawh sungah a vui uhi; tam mun pen Joseph suonlehlahte’ gouluo gam a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aaron’ tapa Eleazar a si hi; tuale amate in Ephraim muoltung gam sunga a tapa Phinehas tunga kipie Gibeah ah ama a vui uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
